<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/eng@/~cl_23> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 20. Substitution of section 21"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/eng@/~cl_24> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/7/eng@> .
